I cached the profile pointer locally and added branch-prediction hints so the common valid-field path stays fall-through and the invalid checks are treated as unlikely.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    auto* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0) ||
        __builtin_expect(profileIndex >= p->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return p->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```